    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BARRY AUCTIONEERS & VALUERS  are delighted to welcome you to this lovely three-bedroom semi-detached home in the highly sought-after area of Silverdale, Ballinlough.\r\nFrom the moment you arrive, this property offers a wonderful combination of space, comfort and practicality, making it an ideal home for families, first-time buyers or anyone looking for a well-positioned property with excellent additional space.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is bright and welcoming, with three well-proportioned bedrooms and comfortable living accommodation throughout.\r\n\r\nOne of the standout features of this home is the converted attic, providing an excellent additional space for storage purposes only.\r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from external insulation, an important feature that can contribute to improved energy efficiency and year-round comfort.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property has another fantastic advantage, a concrete shed as well as a detached garage, offering excellent storage and versatility. It could be ideal for those who need space for tools, bikes, equipment or a home workshop.\r\n\r\nThe location is another major attraction. Situated in Silverdale, Ballinlough, the property is conveniently positioned for access to a wide range of local amenities, schools, shops, recreational facilities and transport links, while still providing the feel of an established residential setting.\r\nOverall, this is a charming three-bedroom semi-detached home really needs to be viewed to be fully appreciated."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Hallway - \r\nSolid wood flooring with under stair storage.\r\n\r\nLiving room - 4.3m x 4.1m \r\nCarpet flooring, marble surround fire place with large built in dresser, large window overlooking front garden.\r\n\r\nKitchen - 6.2m x 3.3m \r\nSolid wood  flooring and eye level units, over counter tiles and a built in dresser with doors to both the sun room and utility room. \n\r\n\r\nUtility room - 2.6m x 2.2m \r\nTile flooring, sink and drainer, door to back garden.\r\n\r\nSun room - 3.7m x 3.65m \r\nSolid wood flooring, large window overlooking rear garden.\n\r\n\r\nStairs & Landing - \r\nWith carpet flooring. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.0m x 3.1m \r\nDouble bedroom to the rear of the property. The room has carpet flooring and extensive built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.0m x 3.8m \r\nDouble bedroom to the front of the property with built in wardrobes and carpet flooring. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.0m x 2.0m \r\nSingle room to the front of the house with carpet flooring and built in wardrobes. \r\n\r\nMain bathroom - 2.8m x 2.1m \r\nTile flooring, bath, separate electric shower, heated towel rail, built in vanity unit with whb and wc\n\r\n\r\nAttic storage - 4.0m x 4.0m \r\nWith carpet flooring \n\r\n\r\nWc & whb. - 2.9m x 2.0m \r\n\r\n\r\n"
      },
